DreamWidgetDesignerData:DesignViewportSize {
    at    Source/DreamGUIEditor/Public/DreamWidgetBlueprint.h#DreamWidgetDesignerData:DesignViewportSize
    src   "Device resolution the designer picked. The hierarchy's own canvas-scaler rule turns it into\nCanvasSize, which is why the two differ for anything but ConstantPixelSize. Zero means nobody\nhas picked one, in which case CanvasSize is the resolution."
    text  "设计器选择的设备分辨率。层级自身的画布缩放器规则会将其转换为\nCanvasSize，因此除 ConstantPixelSize 之外两者都会不同。为零表示尚未\n选择，此时 CanvasSize 即为分辨率。"
    state machine
}

