DreamWidgetTextDispatcher {
    at    Source/DreamGUIEditor/Public/DreamWidgetBlueprint.h#DreamWidgetTextDispatcher
    src   "One `events` entry as a compile declared it: the dispatcher's name and its parameters, as the variable descriptions\n(name and pin type) its signature graph is made from. Kept so a compile whose .dui does not build can declare the\ndispatcher again -- see UDreamWidgetBlueprint::LastGoodDispatchers."
    text  "编译声明的一个`events`条目：调度器的名称及其参数，即其签名图所依据的变量描述\n（名称与引脚类型）。保留它是为了让.dui无法构建的编译能够重新声明该\n调度器——参见控件蓝图UDreamWidgetBlueprint::LastGoodDispatchers。"
    state machine
}
